and a 1.7.0 release.

From Codex's CHANGELOG:
- 1.3.5: fleet-wide fault-distribution pie chart in the Stations tab.
- 1.4.0: Desktop Dataset & Retrain tab. It imports monthly PCAP datasets
  (ZIP or folder) into managed, SHA-256-deduplicated storage.
- 1.5.0: Desktop Ground Truth Label tab. Each imported PCAP is labelled
  Normal, Fault or Exclude, with revisions and an audit history.
- 1.6.0: Desktop Train Model tab. It runs LSTM-AE/GRU fine-tuning on
  fully reviewed batches into isolated candidate artifacts, and requires
  held-out validation plus manual approval.
- 1.7.0: a PCAP-derived Station Health score for all 212 stations, kept
  separate from the AI benchmark score.

